            <a href="/dashboard?view=pending" class="block py-2 px-3 text-heading rounded hover:bg-neutral-tertiary md:hover:bg-transparent md:border-0 md:hover:text-fg-brand md:p-0 md:dark:hover:bg-transparent">Needs Approval</a>
